t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"LineDescription\">Line description</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Description From FromDate Invoice Item Line On Sales SalesInvoice\">The description of the specific line item from the sales invoice.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyInvoiced\">Qty Invoiced</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyInvoiced\">Qty Invoiced</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"InventoryItem Invoice Invoiced Is Item Sales SalesOrder To ToDate Total\">The quantity of the inventory item that was invoiced. The total at the bottom shows the cumulative quantity invoiced for this item against the sales order.</p></div></details>",
  "key": "sales-order-qty-invoiced-transactions"
